===============================================================================
USER & FORUM DOMAIN - IMPLEMENTATION DIAGRAM
===============================================================================

PURPOSE:
This UML class diagram shows the actual Java/JPA implementation of the user
management, authentication, and forum system.

SCOPE:
- User entities with authentication
- Role-based access control (RBAC)
- Forum posts and comments
- Tag system for categorization
- Password reset functionality

PACKAGE:
nl.hva.dederdekamer.election_backend.entities

TECHNOLOGY:
- Jakarta Persistence (JPA)
- Spring Security with JWT
- BCrypt password hashing
- Bean Validation (jakarta.validation)
- Jackson for JSON serialization

LAST UPDATED: December 2025 (Sprint 4)
===============================================================================
'/

